            <ArticleTitle>Pharmacologic pain management at the end of life.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-37</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000482376.29488.79</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Escalating pain is common in the final weeks of life, requiring skilled management to assist patients with a life-limiting illness. Using a cancer model, pharmacologic approaches to treat pain in the final weeks of life are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
